# Per-test knobs for ci/tasks/run-tests.sh. Sourced, so plain assignments only.

# This test asks the version managers for a node, a java and a python the image
# does not ship. Their state lives in the rootfs rather than in $CACHE_DIRECTORY,
# so nothing carries over and every run downloads all three by design - which
# would otherwise read as a cache miss.
SKIP_CACHE_CHECK="true"
